# Internal repo files must not be publicly served (ZV1 Security Standard).
# Cloudflare Pages ignores a 404 status here and never rewrites over an existing file, but a redirect does win.
# Each rule redirects to a path that does not exist, so the visitor ends on the real 404 page (noindex).
/CLAUDE.md /no-such-page 302
/SECURITY.md /no-such-page 302
/README.md /no-such-page 302
/.gitignore /no-such-page 302
/.claude/* /no-such-page 302
